--             2) cohort        – first quickplay date (day-0) per user & event_type.  
--             3) sessions      – all session_start events 01-Aug-2018 – 31-Aug-2018 (covers max day-14 for a 15-Aug cohort).  
--             4) retained      – users whose session_start is 8-14 days after *their own* day-0.  
--             5) cohort_size   – user count in each quickplay cohort.  
--             6) retained_cnt  – user count retained in week-2.  
--             7) Final SELECT  – retention rate, ranked lowest first (LIMIT 20 for preview).  
